WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:45.000
You are welcome to 7EVEN. I be your virtual travel companion, here to help you discover places wey worth experiencing. You dey find hotel for Uyo? Make we find place wey match wetin you need. No guesswork. No made-up hotel availability. Na only information wey you fit trust. And if you need small help as we dey go, I dey right here. Make we explore Nigeria, one destination at a time. Welcome to 7EVEN āprən.
